OL,3,CBlackpool Tower lights up for murdered
OL,4,CPreston Davey
OL,6,FA vigil for Preston Davey, the toddler
OL,7,Fmurdered by his adoptive father, has
OL,8,Fbeen held on the third anniversary of
OL,9,Fhis death.
OL,11,FBlackpool Tower was lit up in blue to
OL,12,Fremember Preston and people shared a
OL,13,Fmoment of reflection, prayers as well
OL,14,Fas leaving teddies and flowers for the
OL,15,Fyoungster.
OL,17,FThe tribute had been requested by
OL,18,FPreston's birth mum Sarah Davey.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
