OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785313146
OL,3,CBlackpool Tower lights up for murdered
OL,4,CPreston Davey
OL,6,FPreston was just 13-months-old when he
OL,7,Fwas killed by his adoptive dad, Jamie
OL,8,FVarley, after being placed with Varley
OL,9,Fand his partner John McGowan-
OL,10,FFazakerley as prospective adopters in
OL,11,FMarch 2023
OL,13,FA seven-week trial at Preston Crown
OL,14,FCourt heard how Preston endured
OL,15,Fextensive physical, emotional, and
OL,16,Fsexual abuse, suffering around 40
OL,17,Finjuries before his death.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
