PN,36703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785313146
OL,3,CBlackpool Tower lights up for murdered
OL,4,CPreston Davey
OL,6,FDescribed by prosecutors as one of the
OL,7,Fmost shocking cases they had ever
OL,8,Fencountered, the trial concluded with
OL,9,FVarley receiving a whole life order
OL,10,Ffor murder, sexual offences, grievous
OL,11,Fbodily harm, cruelty, and indecent
OL,12,Fimage offences.
OL,14,FMcGowan-Fazakerley was found guilty of
OL,15,Fcausing or allowing the death of a
OL,16,Fchild, cruelty, and sexual assault,
OL,17,Fand was sentenced to 25 years in
OL,18,Fprison.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
