OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1785313146
OL,3,CBlackpool Tower lights up for murdered
OL,4,CPreston Davey
OL,6,FA jury heard how Preston was routinely
OL,7,Fill-treated, physically assaulted, and
OL,8,Fsexually abused while in their care
OL,9,Ffor just under four months at their
OL,10,Fhome in Blackpool.
OL,12,FPreston had been taken from his
OL,13,Fmother, Sarah Davey, now 42, by an
OL,14,Femergency care order by Oldham Council.
OL,16,FWant more on the issues effecting the
OL,17,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,18,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,19,Four region.
